flowchart LR
  ask([提出需求]) --> explore[唯讀調查<br/>讀檔、搜尋]
  subagent[Subagent<br/>協助蒐集資料] -.-> explore
  permission-mode[Permission Mode<br/>切到規劃模式] -.-> explore
  explore --> draft[提出計畫]
  draft --> human-in-the-loop{你審查計畫<br/>Human-in-the-loop}
  human-in-the-loop -- 修改意見 --> draft
  human-in-the-loop -- 同意 --> exec[開始修改檔案]
  exec --> result[完成並回報]
